<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>动态 | 智能感知与决策实验室</title><link>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/blog/</link><atom:link href="https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/blog/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><description>动态</description><generator>HugoBlox Kit (https://hugoblox.com)</generator><language>zh-Hans</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><image><url>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/media/icon_hu_2dc8a7743be9bda7.png</url><title>动态</title><link>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/blog/</link></image><item><title>登终南·望群峰——记实验室南五台秋日团建活动</title><link>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/blog/2026-south-wutai-team-building/</link><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/blog/2026-south-wutai-team-building/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;
&lt;figure &gt;
&lt;div class="flex justify-center "&gt;
&lt;div class="w-full" &gt;
&lt;img alt="登山合影"
srcset="https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/blog/2026-south-wutai-team-building/gallery/01_hu_b074292f4d79311b.webp 320w, https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/blog/2026-south-wutai-team-building/gallery/01_hu_5d78f4c66b3557ef.webp 480w, https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/blog/2026-south-wutai-team-building/gallery/01_hu_d021c1f1d1f7c22d.webp 760w"
sizes="(max-width: 480px) 100vw, (max-width: 768px) 90vw, (max-width: 1024px) 80vw, 760px"
src="https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/blog/2026-south-wutai-team-building/gallery/01_hu_b074292f4d79311b.webp"
width="760"
height="570"
loading="lazy" data-zoomable /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;秋日登高，尽览终南秀色&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;南五台作为终南山的著名胜景，以“奇峰、古寺、云海、秋色”闻名。活动当日，天高云淡，微风拂面，正是登高的好时节。大家沿着山径拾级而上，虽山路蜿蜒、台阶陡峭，但成员们相互鼓励、彼此扶持，一路欢声笑语，共同向山顶进发。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
&lt;figure &gt;
&lt;div class="flex justify-center "&gt;
&lt;div class="w-full" &gt;
&lt;img alt="风景1"
srcset="https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/blog/2026-south-wutai-team-building/gallery/02_hu_fcc7a104bb0b0f9c.webp 320w, https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/blog/2026-south-wutai-team-building/gallery/02_hu_f2e7ee3e5252124a.webp 480w, https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/blog/2026-south-wutai-team-building/gallery/02_hu_f74c59f4a5b3abd9.webp 760w"
sizes="(max-width: 480px) 100vw, (max-width: 768px) 90vw, (max-width: 1024px) 80vw, 760px"
src="https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/blog/2026-south-wutai-team-building/gallery/02_hu_fcc7a104bb0b0f9c.webp"
width="760"
height="570"
loading="lazy" data-zoomable /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;行至高处，远眺层峦叠嶂，群山连绵，秋叶斑斓，云雾缭绕间尽显终南山的壮阔与灵秀。山顶红墙金顶的古建筑在苍翠与秋黄的交织中格外醒目，大家纷纷驻足，用镜头记录下这秀美的自然风光与攀登的喜悦。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
&lt;figure &gt;
&lt;div class="flex justify-center "&gt;
&lt;div class="w-full" &gt;
&lt;img alt="风景2"
srcset="https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/blog/2026-south-wutai-team-building/gallery/03_hu_49fc102c0add5c8a.webp 320w, https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/blog/2026-south-wutai-team-building/gallery/03_hu_31a90f55ce854a5e.webp 480w, https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/blog/2026-south-wutai-team-building/gallery/03_hu_443dd5508dbd3405.webp 760w"
sizes="(max-width: 480px) 100vw, (max-width: 768px) 90vw, (max-width: 1024px) 80vw, 760px"
src="https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/blog/2026-south-wutai-team-building/gallery/03_hu_49fc102c0add5c8a.webp"
width="760"
height="570"
loading="lazy" data-zoomable /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;合影留念，定格青春时光&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;在“终南山·南五台”标志牌前，全体成员合影留念。大家比出大拇指，笑容灿烂，展现了实验室团队蓬勃向上的朝气与团结奋进的精神面貌。正如标志牌上“我愿和你在此许下海誓山盟”的浪漫寓意，这次攀登也见证了大家携手同行的深厚情谊。前排成员手持的绿色对勾标识，更象征着我们科研路上“攻坚克难、使命必达”的坚定信念。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;凝心聚力，共赴科研新程&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“会当凌绝顶，一览众山小。”此次南五台之行，不仅让大家在繁忙的科研学习之余放松了身心，领略了大自然的壮美，更在攀登中磨砺了意志，增强了实验室的向心力。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;未来，实验室全体成员将继续保持这份攀登的勇气与协作的默契，在科研道路上勇攀高峰，再创佳绩！&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>欢迎2026级新生加入实验室</title><link>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/blog/2026-welcome/</link><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/blog/2026-welcome/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;欢迎2026级新生同学加入智能感知与决策实验室。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>